      },
      "id": 100,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### CLIP & Florence-2 Intelligence Dashboard\n\nThis dashboard monitors the two key vision models in the enrichment pipeline.\n\n**CLIP (Contrastive Language-Image Pre-training):**\n- Scene classification: Categorizes frames into security-relevant scene types\n- Threat matching: Compares scenes against threat description embeddings\n- Anomaly scoring: Detects unusual visual patterns compared to baseline\n\n**Florence-2:**\n- Object detection: Identifies security-relevant objects (people, vehicles, packages)\n- Dense captioning: Generates detailed scene descriptions for Nemotron context\n- Enhanced extraction: Combines OCR + detection + captioning for rich context\n\n**Model Labels:** CLIP models use `clip-scene`, `clip-threat`, `clip-anomaly` labels. Florence uses `florence-enhanced`, `florence-caption`, `florence-detect` labels."
      },
      "title": "Documentation",
      "type": "text"
    },
